{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2008_q001", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2008", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2008, "question_number": 1, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["罗尔定理", "导数零点"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2008_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2008_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q001.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "D", "explanation": "由 $f(0)=f(1)=f(2)=0$，在区间 $(0,1)$、$(1,2)$ 内各由罗尔定理得到一个零点。\n又 $f'(x)$ 是三次多项式，不可能恰有两个实零点，因此只能有三个实零点，选 D。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2008_q002", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2008", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2008, "question_number": 2, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["定积分几何意义"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2008_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2008_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q002.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png", "images/q002_diagram.png"], "answer": "C", "explanation": "分部积分得\n$$\n\\int_0^a xf'(x)\\,dx=af(a)-\\int_0^a f(x)\\,dx.\n$$\n其中 $af(a)$ 是矩形 $ABOC$ 的面积，$\\int_0^a f(x)\\,dx$ 是曲边梯形 $ABOD$ 的面积，\n二者之差正是曲边三角形 $ACD$ 的面积，故选 C。", "methods": ["分部积分"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2008_q003", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2008", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2008, "question_number": 3, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["常系数线性微分方程", "特征方程"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2008_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2008_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q003.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "D", "explanation": "通解对应特征根为 $1,\\pm2i$，故特征方程为\n$$\n(r-1)(r^2+4)=r^3-r^2+4r-4=0.\n$$\n因而对应微分方程为 $y'''-y''+4y'-4y=0$，选 D。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2008_q004", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2008", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2008, "question_number": 4, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["间断点", "极限"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2008_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2008_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q004.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "A", "explanation": "在 $x=0,1$ 处函数无定义。由\n$$\n\\lim_{x\\to0}\\ln|x|\\sin x=0\n$$\n可知 $x=0$ 是可去间断点；而 $x\\to1^\\pm$ 时左右极限存在但不相等，所以 $x=1$ 是跳跃间断点，选 A。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2008_q005", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2008", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2008, "question_number": 5, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["单调有界函数", "数列极限"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2008_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2008_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q005.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "B", "explanation": "若 $\\{x_n\\}$ 单调，则由 $f$ 单调知 $\\{f(x_n)\\}$ 也单调；又因为 $f$ 有界，故 $\\{f(x_n)\\}$ 单调有界，\n必收敛，因此 B 正确。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2008_q006", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2008", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2008, "question_number": 6, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["二重积分", "变上限积分"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2008_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2008_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q006.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png", "images/q006_diagram.png"], "answer": "A", "explanation": "改用极坐标，区域为 $1\\le r\\le u,\\ 0\\le\\theta\\le v$，故\n$$\nF(u,v)=\\int_0^v\\int_1^u f(r^2)\\,dr\\,d\\theta\n=v\\int_1^u f(r^2)\\,dr.\n$$\n对 $u$ 求导即得\n$$\n\\frac{\\partial F}{\\partial u}=vf(u^2).\n$$", "methods": ["极坐标变换"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2008_q007", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2008", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2008, "question_number": 7, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 4, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["矩阵可逆", "幂零矩阵"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2008_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2008_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q007.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "C", "explanation": "因为 $A^3=O$，有\n$$\n(E-A)(E+A+A^2)=E-A^3=E,\n$$\n$$\n(E+A)(E-A+A^2)=E+A^3=E.\n$$\n所以 $E-A$、$E+A$ 都可逆，选 C。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2008_q008", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2008", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2008, "question_number": 8, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 4, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["矩阵合同", "实对称矩阵"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2008_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2008_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q008.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "D", "explanation": "$A$ 为实对称矩阵，其特征值为 $3,-1$，惯性指标为 $(1,1)$。四个选项中只有 D 的特征值也为 $3,-1$，\n与 $A$ 有相同惯性指标，因此在实数域上与 $A$ 合同，选 D。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2008_q009", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2008", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2008, "question_number": 9, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["极限", "连续性"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2008_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2008_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q009.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$2$", "explanation": "由 $1-\\cos t\\sim \\dfrac{t^2}{2}$，$e^{x^2}-1\\sim x^2$，得\n$$\n\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{\\frac12x^2f^2(x)}{x^2f(x)}=\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{f(x)}2=1.\n$$\n由连续性可知 $f(0)=2$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2008_q010", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2008", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2008, "question_number": 10, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["一阶微分方程", "线性方程"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2008_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2008_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q010.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$y=(x-1)e^{-x}+Cx$", "explanation": "方程化为\n$$\ny'-\\frac1x y=xe^{-x}.\n$$\n线性方程积分因子为 $x^{-1}$，故\n$$\n\\left(\\frac yx\\right)'=e^{-x}.\n$$\n积分得\n$$\n\\frac yx=-(x+1)\\frac{e^{-x}}x + C,\n$$\n整理可得\n$$\ny=(x-1)e^{-x}+Cx.\n$$", "methods": ["积分因子"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2008_q011", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2008", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2008, "question_number": 11, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["隐函数", "切线方程"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2008_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2008_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q011.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$y=x+1$", "explanation": "设\n$$\nF(x,y)=\\sin(xy)+\\ln(y-x)-x.\n$$\n由隐函数求导得\n$$\nF_x+F_y y'=0.\n$$\n在 $(0,1)$ 处代入可得 $y'(0)=1$，故切线方程为\n$$\ny-1=1(x-0),\n$$\n即 $y=x+1$。", "methods": ["隐函数求导"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2008_q012", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2008", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2008, "question_number": 12, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["拐点", "导数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2008_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2008_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q012.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$(-1,-6)$", "explanation": "计算二阶导数并考察符号变化。可得 $x=-1$ 时 $y''=0$ 且两侧异号，$x=0$ 虽不可导但两侧同号，\n故真正的拐点在 $x=-1$。代入原式得 $y=-6$，故拐点为 $(-1,-6)$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2008_q013", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2008", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2008, "question_number": 13, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["多元复合函数", "偏导数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2008_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2008_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q013.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$2(\\ln 2-1)$", "explanation": "令 $u=\\dfrac yx,\\ v=\\dfrac xy$，则 $z=u^v$。先取对数\n$$\n\\ln z=\\frac xy\\ln\\frac yx,\n$$\n再对 $x$ 求偏导并在 $(1,2)$ 处代入，可得\n$$\n\\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial x}=2(\\ln2-1).\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2008_q014", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2008", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2008, "question_number": 14, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["特征值", "行列式"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2008_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2008_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q014.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$-1$", "explanation": "由特征值性质，\n$$\n|A|=2\\cdot3\\cdot\\lambda=6\\lambda.\n$$\n又\n$$\n|2A|=2^3|A|=8\\cdot6\\lambda=48\\lambda=-48,\n$$\n故 $\\lambda=-1$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2008_q015", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2008", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2008, "question_number": 15, "question_type": "solution", "score": 9, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["极限", "泰勒展开"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2008_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2008_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q015.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac16$", "explanation": "由\n$$\n\\sin x=x-\\frac{x^3}{6}+o(x^3),\\qquad\n\\sin(\\sin x)=\\sin x-\\frac{\\sin^3x}{6}+o(x^3),\n$$\n得\n$$\n\\sin x-\\sin(\\sin x)=\\frac{x^3}{6}+o(x^3).\n$$\n再乘以 $\\sin x\\sim x$，所以原式极限为 $\\dfrac16$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2008_q016", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2008", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2008, "question_number": 16, "question_type": "solution", "score": 10, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["参数方程", "二阶导数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2008_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2008_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q016.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac{d^2y}{dx^2}=(1+t^2)\\bigl[\\ln(1+t^2)+1\\bigr]$", "explanation": "由微分方程得\n$$\nxe^x=t^2,\\qquad x=\\ln(1+t^2).\n$$\n又\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dt}=2t\\ln(1+t^2),\\qquad\n\\frac{dx}{dt}=\\frac{2t}{1+t^2}.\n$$\n因而\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}=(1+t^2)\\ln(1+t^2).\n$$\n再对 $t$ 求导并除以 $\\dfrac{dx}{dt}$，得\n$$\n\\frac{d^2y}{dx^2}=(1+t^2)\\bigl[\\ln(1+t^2)+1\\bigr].\n$$", "methods": ["隐函数求导"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2008_q017", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2008", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2008, "question_number": 17, "question_type": "solution", "score": 9, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["反常积分"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2008_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2008_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q017.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac{\\pi^2}{16}+\\dfrac14$", "explanation": "令 $t=\\arcsin x$，则 $x=\\sin t,\\ dx=\\cos t\\,dt,\\ t\\in[0,\\pi/2]$，\n原积分化为\n$$\n\\int_0^{\\pi/2} t\\sin^2 t\\,dt\n=\\frac12\\int_0^{\\pi/2}t\\,dt-\\frac12\\int_0^{\\pi/2}t\\cos2t\\,dt.\n$$\n计算得结果为\n$$\n\\frac{\\pi^2}{16}+\\frac14.\n$$", "methods": ["换元积分"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2008_q018", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2008", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2008, "question_number": 18, "question_type": "solution", "score": 11, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["二重积分", "分区域积分"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2008_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2008_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q018.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac{19}{4}+\\ln2$", "explanation": "曲线 $xy=1$ 将正方形区域分成两部分：一部分取值为 $1$，另一部分取值为 $xy$。\n按 $xy\\le1$ 与 $xy\\ge1$ 分区积分，整理可得\n$$\n\\iint_D\\max\\{xy,1\\}\\,dx\\,dy=\\frac{19}{4}+\\ln2.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2008_q019", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2008", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2008, "question_number": 19, "question_type": "solution", "score": 11, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["微分方程", "旋转体侧面积"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2008_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2008_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q019.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$f(x)=\\dfrac12\\left(e^x+e^{-x}\\right)$", "explanation": "体积与侧面积分别为\n$$\nV(t)=\\pi\\int_0^t f^2(x)\\,dx,\\qquad\nS(t)=2\\pi\\int_0^t f(x)\\sqrt{1+f'^2(x)}\\,dx.\n$$\n由题设 $S(t)=2V(t)$，对 $t$ 求导得\n$$\nf\\sqrt{1+f'^2}=f^2.\n$$\n因为 $f>0$，故\n$$\n1+f'^2=f^2.\n$$\n解得\n$$\nf(x)=\\frac12\\left(e^x+e^{-x}\\right),\n$$\n再由 $f(0)=1$ 选定常数。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2008_q020", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2008", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2008, "question_number": 20, "question_type": "proof", "score": 11, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["积分中值定理", "拉格朗日中值定理"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2008_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2008_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q020.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "见解析", "explanation": "（Ⅰ）由连续函数在闭区间上有界，设最小值为 $m$、最大值为 $M$，则\n$$\nm(b-a)\\le\\int_a^b f(x)\\,dx\\le M(b-a).\n$$\n再由介值定理即可得存在 $\\eta$ 满足结论。\n\n（Ⅱ）先由（Ⅰ）得存在 $\\eta\\in[2,3]$ 使\n$$\n\\int_2^3\\varphi(x)\\,dx=\\varphi(\\eta).\n$$\n结合题设可得 $\\eta>2$。随后分别在 $[1,2]$ 与 $[2,\\eta]$ 上使用拉格朗日中值定理，\n得到一处导数为正、一处导数为负，再在两点之间对 $\\varphi'$ 应用拉格朗日中值定理，即得某点 $\\xi$ 使 $\\varphi''(\\xi)<0$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2008_q021", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2008", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2008, "question_number": 21, "question_type": "solution", "score": 11, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["条件极值"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2008_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2008_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q021.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "最小值为 $6$，最大值为 $72$", "explanation": "将约束化为平面与抛物面的交线上的最值问题，可用拉格朗日乘数法，\n也可先代入 $z=x^2+y^2$ 后化成二元函数求条件极值。求得临界点为\n$$\n(1,1,2),\\qquad (-2,-2,8),\n$$\n对应\n$$\nu=6,\\qquad u=72.\n$$\n故最小值为 $6$，最大值为 $72$。", "methods": ["拉格朗日乘数法"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2008_q022", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2008", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2008, "question_number": 22, "question_type": "solution", "score": 12, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["行列式", "线性方程组"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2008_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2008_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q022.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "见解析", "explanation": "记 $D_n=|A|$，按第一列或用递推可证\n$$\nD_n=(n+1)a^n.\n$$\n因而当且仅当 $a\\ne0$ 时，$D_n\\ne0$，方程组有唯一解。由克拉默法则可得\n$$\nx_1=\\frac{n}{(n+1)a}.\n$$\n当 $a=0$ 时，系数矩阵与增广矩阵秩同为 $n-1$，故有无穷多解；通解可写成\n$$\nx_1=1,\\ x_2=t,\\ x_3=-t,\\ \\ldots\n$$\n的等价参数形式，其中保留一个自由参数。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2008_q023", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2008", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2008, "question_number": 23, "question_type": "solution", "score": 10, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["特征向量", "Jordan 标准形"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2008_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2008_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q023.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "$P^{-1}AP=\\begin{pmatrix}-1&0&0\\\\0&1&1\\\\0&0&1\\end{pmatrix}$", "explanation": "因为 $\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2$ 分属不同特征值，先知它们线性无关。若 $\\alpha_3$ 能由前两者线性表示，\n代入\n$$\nA\\alpha_3=\\alpha_2+\\alpha_3\n$$\n后比较系数会与 $\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2$ 的线性无关性矛盾，因此三向量线性无关。\n以这组三向量为基，$A$ 的作用为\n$$\nA\\alpha_1=-\\alpha_1,\\qquad A\\alpha_2=\\alpha_2,\\qquad A\\alpha_3=\\alpha_2+\\alpha_3,\n$$\n所以\n$$\nP^{-1}AP=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n-1&0&0\\\\\n0&1&1\\\\\n0&0&1\n\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$", "methods": []}
